<TXSPN>―All right, thank you very much!
{PAUSE ""}
　And now, our next segment. At this time on Tuesdays, it's 'This Path, I, Master!' 
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\0.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
Now, what sort of master will be making an appearance today? 
{PAUSE ""}
This time we've left the studio, and we're bringing it to you live. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yuki-chan, at the scene!?
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\TALK_and_WALK.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\葛飾区公園.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Yes! I, Yukino <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しんばし">Shinbashi</STYLE>, am continuing to report from this park in Katsushika Ward!
{PAUSE ""}
　Today I'd like to introduce this week's master!
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
　We're told today's master is in a building right by the park, inside this one, but―"
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\4.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's kind of a creepy building...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who is this week's master, here inside this suspicious building? 
{PAUSE ""}
I'd like to go in and pay a visit."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\5.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nアイテム3\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\占いの館.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Um... good morning. 
{PAUSE ""}
Where could they be?
{PAUSE ""}
　My name is Yukino Shinbashi, from Japonica TV."
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nアイテム3\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's dim in there. Could it be a medium or something...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, take a look, there's a woman in a mask sitting over there."<PG>
"Good morning. Are you this week's master!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Good morning. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, I'm this week's master... 
{PAUSE ""}
not that I'm anything so grand, but I'm a fortune-teller by the name of <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ゆうこ">Yuko</STYLE> Stella."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A fortune-teller!"<BR>
―A fortune-teller!
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\7.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\7.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"Yuko Stella-san, aren't you a celebrity!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, no, I only show up in a magazine now and then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I've seen you in a magazine!
{PAUSE ""}
　If I remember right, they call you an authority on physiognomy."
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, that's overstating it. 
{PAUSE ""}
I just look at people's faces any old way, say any old thing, and it happens to be right, that's all."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\8.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"No, no, you don't become a fortune-teller this renowned any old way.
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\9.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today, I understand you'll be reading my face, but―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, yes. Well then, have a seat here, please. 
{PAUSE ""}
What do you want to ask about, miss? Love, work, luck with money, anything's fine."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um, well then... 
{PAUSE ""}
How do things look for my work from here on?"
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\10.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"Work, all right. Then look this way."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\11.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"The world probably knows your work is going well, but that's only the world's assessment. 
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
There's a lot you yourself aren't happy with, isn't there?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Things I'm not happy with?"
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\12.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The work you want to do... 
{PAUSE ""}
Mm, let's see... 
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
It looks like you're content with the work itself, but there seems to be some problem in your private life. 
{PAUSE ""}
What you're not happy with is the private life your work is squeezing."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
"My private life..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's a bit much to say on TV, but your work keeps you so busy, your room's gotten pretty messy, hasn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Um... I guess so... 
{PAUSE ""}
I might not be keeping it very tidy..."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\13.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\14.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You need to take a little more care with your meals, too. 
{PAUSE ""}
You're still young, so it's fine, but right now you seem to have no appetite at all."<PG>
"I eat three square meals a day, though..."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム3" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\15.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\nアイテム3\r\n3\r\n650\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Appetite is the urge that says I want to eat that, I want to eat this. 
{PAUSE ""}
Thinking you have to take in the nutrition you need to live is different from appetite. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure you don't think like that."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, I guess... 
{PAUSE ""}
Mostly I just eat the boxed lunches they hand out on location..."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\16.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム3\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"Human beings die without food and sleep. 
{MOTION "789" "アイテム3" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム3" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
It's probably a busy job, but first you should try thinking about enjoying your meals. 
{PAUSE ""}
If your appetite's satisfied, you ought to put just the right amount of effort into your work too."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\17.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"First, instead of just eating whatever food you're given, try thinking about what you want to eat. 
{PAUSE ""}
How your work turns out depends on that."
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\シャベッター.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr145\シャベッター\18.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n340\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "123" "アイテム2" "3" "650" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
<PG>
"Is there any particular kind of food that would be good?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let's see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Meals you eat with a knife and fork would be good. 
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
If you usually eat boxed lunches, you're probably using nothing but chopsticks or a spoon. 
{PAUSE ""}
So, to get away from that all at once, you make a point of trying a knife and fork."
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "960" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ooh...! I understand! Thank you so much!
